[en.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_ARMY]
Aspiration of Hooflyn

[en.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_ARMY_desc]
Manehattan is calling, we cannot stand idly by.\n\nThe Army Department will make a plan, prepare military forces, and destroy the rule of the Gladmane Group, once and for all.

[en.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_ARMY_TOOLTIP]
Prepare the §Yarmy§! to quickly destroy the reign of the Business Alliance\nUnlock decision in §YStarlight Radio§!: §YReinforce Northern Hooflyn§!\nUnlock decision in §YStarlight Radio§!: §YBorder Raid§!\nWhen recruiting new soldiers, add §Y3 combat groups§! additionally

[zh.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_ARMY]
守望蹄林

[zh.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_ARMY_desc]
马哈顿在呼唤，我们不能袖手旁观。\n\n陆军部将制定计划，准备好军事力量，一举摧毁乐善集团的统治。

[zh.FOCUS_C08_MANEHATTAN_ARMY_TOOLTIP]
准备§Y军队§!，迅速摧毁商业联盟的统治\n解锁§Y星光电台§!中的决议：§Y增援北蹄林城§!\n解锁§Y星光电台§!中的决议：§Y边境突袭§!\n征召新兵时，额外增加§Y3个战斗组§!

